      "displayText": "<U+E300>49700",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "E300003400390037003000300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真是个算数小天才！\n我会再来的，到时候就拜了个托咯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F662F4E2A7B9765705C0F5929624DFF01000A62114F1A518D67657684FF0C523065F650195C3162DC4E864E2A625854AF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你让人有点小失望啊。\n我会再来的，到时候就拜了个托咯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BA94EBA670970B95C0F5931671B554A3002000A62114F1A518D67657684FF0C523065F650195C3162DC4E864E2A625854AF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦了！\n谢谢你帮我看店。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B82E64E86FF01000A8C228C224F605E2E6211770B5E97300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，我们来确认\n商品和营业额吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C62114EEC6765786E8BA4000A554654C1548C84254E1A989D5427300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～！你可能不适合看店。\n要说看店级别，你只有Z级。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF5EFF014F6053EF80FD4E0D90025408770B5E973002000A89818BF4770B5E977EA7522BFF0C4F6053EA6709005A7EA7300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……\n突然看店可能对你来说太难了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF20262026000A7A817136770B5E9753EF80FD5BF94F6067658BF4592A96BE4E86300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以看店来说，\n可能不算太成功。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE5770B5E9767658BF4FF0C000A53EF80FD4E0D7B97592A6210529F300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你看店看得普普通通。\n普通并不是什么坏事哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F60770B5E97770B5F97666E666E901A901A3002000A666E901A5E764E0D662F4EC04E48574F4E8B54E6300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你看店看得相当出色嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F60770B5E97770B5F9776F85F5351FA8272561B300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "绝了！好厉害！\n我遇到看店的劲敌了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EDD4E86FF01597D53895BB3FF01000A621190475230770B5E97768452B2654C4E86FF0100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>得到了\n<U+E300><U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>作为奖励！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000005F9752304E86000AE300001000030204000200004F5C4E3A595652B1FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "独自看家的冻脊龙\n把家里冻得冰冰凉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72EC81EA770B5BB6768451BB810A9F99000A628A5BB691CC51BB5F9751B051B051C9300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之你帮了大忙！\n下次请以客人的身份过来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4B4F605E2E4E8659275FD9FF01000A4E0B6B218BF74EE55BA24EBA76848EAB4EFD8FC767655427300200100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要趁现在查看商品的价格吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818D8173B0572867E5770B554654C176844EF7683C5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "查看",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
